  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes industry-standard monitoring frameworks, DevOps environments, and developer tools for ongoing support:\n\n- **Monitoring & Telemetry**: Uptime Kuma, Prometheus, Grafana, Pingdom\n- **Version Control & CI/CD**: GitHub, GitHub Actions, Docker\n- **Server Infrastructure**: Linux (Ubuntu/Debian VPS), Cloudflare, Nginx\n- **Database Maintenance**: PostgreSQL, Supabase, Redis\n- **Ticketing & Communication**: Helpdesk Portal, Slack, WhatsApp, Email Support\n\n---",
